meta {
  name: 23 1  start a conversation
  type: http
  seq: 23
}

post {
  url: {{host}}/_nl
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "prompt": "show me shoes",
    "session": "{{session}}"
  }
}

docs {
  Chat bots: sessions and history - 1 - start a conversation

  Everything in this folder sends the same session, set in the collection variables. That one field is all a bot needs: nothing to open, nothing to close.

  Run these five in order and watch the body field change rather than reset.
}
